     _e_a_p_p_s_k  16-byte pre-shared key in hex format for use with EAP-PSK.

     _n_a_i     User NAI for use with EAP-PSK.

     _s_e_r_v_e_r___n_a_i
             Authentication Server NAI for use with EAP-PSK.

